@host = http://localhost:5212

### 1. Get a dev token (customer or admin)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "customer" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Browse / search the catalog (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=csk&sortBy=price&pageSize=5

### 3. Add to cart (use a product id from the call above)
POST {{host}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "quantity": 2 }

### 4. View cart
GET {{host}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Checkout (retry-safe: reuse the same key to replay)
POST {{host}}/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-checkout-001

### 6. Order history
GET {{host}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
